# @tool secret — generate and store private machine-local credentials
# @detail secret
#   secret generate [LENGTH]                 URL-safe value (default 32 characters)
#   secret generate hex [LENGTH]             exact-length hexadecimal value
#   secret generate base64 [BYTES]           random bytes encoded as base64
#   secret generate uuid                     lowercase RFC 4122 UUID v4
#   secret set NAME [--stdin] [--replace]    store a single-line token
#   secret import NAME PATH                  preserve a complete credential file
#   secret path NAME                         print an existing credential's path
#   secret check [NAME]                      audit types, modes, and registrations
#   secret exec NAME VARIABLE -- COMMAND     expose text to one child environment
#   Add --env VARIABLE to set/import to register the file path in env.zsh.
#   Values are never accepted as arguments or printed by storage/status commands.
